<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 5.81 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 5.81 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 5.81 percent in the week ending June 21 from 5.85 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES     June 21     June 14    June 22,1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +5.81	 +5.85	+4.32</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)   324.3	 323.8	306.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended June 22, 1996.</p>
</text>
